// MWSR (MoonlightWeb Super Resolution), the upscale, ported from mwsr/glsl/mwsr-up.frag in github.com/linckosz/moonlight-web to Vulkan GLSL
// for Epinephro: GAZE, CHROMA444, SHOW and HDR paths removed, linear-light fixed off, the dFdy sign made independent of the
// framebuffer flip, and the per-scale "law" values computed on the CPU (sgsr.c) and sent as push constants.
